text:
Frank — thank you for starting this. I can help make a simple printable checklist residents and the school can use:
1) date/time + milepost/location + photo filename (date);
2) truck plate/time, direction, truck type (B‑train/etc);
3) basic water‑sample location (date only) and local buyer price + haul distance (if known).
I can collect names at the library and help upload photos when folks drop them off. Please don’t put yourself in traffic taking pictures — keep a safe distance and note the milepost/time.

OP — please post the exchange, contract and timestamp for that gold quote so we aren’t planning around a units/decimal error. I’m not giving advice — just offering to organize and keep records. — Shirley (retired teacher)
